sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant WEB as Web UI
  participant API as qgp-api
  participant IDP as SSO IdP
  U->>WEB: mở QGP
  WEB->>IDP: redirect OIDC authorize
  IDP-->>WEB: authorization code
  WEB->>API: code
  API->>IDP: exchange code -> tokens
  API-->>WEB: session (role từ claims)
